{"id":"1559033331811923","group":"16","path":"16/16-lem-lawvere.md","title":"等式替换的 mate","display":"lem-lawvere-substitution-equality — 等式替换的 mate","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-lem-lawvere","aliases":["16-lem-lawvere","16-lem--lawvere"],"display":"lem-lawvere-substitution-equality — 等式替换的 mate","depends_on":["[[16-df-sigma-equation]]","[[16-df-algebraic-signature]]","[[16-df-conditional-equational-derivation]]"],"source":"Lemmas 3.2.3–3.2.4, pp.179–181 (PDF199–201); the Frobenius mate form","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-lem-lawvere"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-lem-lawvere</span><span>16-lem--lawvere</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-lawvere-substitution-equality — 等式替换的 mate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"714c179fab3ebb50\" href=\"?note=714c179fab3ebb50\" title=\"16-df-sigma-equation\">16-df-sigma-equation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afcc53893d447b1b\" href=\"?note=afcc53893d447b1b\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-signature\">16-df-algebraic-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"02dbbf0106916f6e\" href=\"?note=02dbbf0106916f6e\" title=\"16-df-conditional-equational-derivation\">16-df-conditional-equational-derivation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Lemmas 3.2.3–3.2.4, pp.179–181 (PDF199–201); the Frobenius mate form"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sub}\">\\(\\mathsf{Sub}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"afcc53893d447b1b\" href=\"?note=afcc53893d447b1b\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-signature\">16-df-algebraic-signature</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma\">\\(H\\subseteq\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"02dbbf0106916f6e\" href=\"?note=02dbbf0106916f6e\" title=\"16-df-conditional-equational-derivation\">16-df-conditional-equational-derivation</a>。所有类型均为不依赖变量的简单排序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in S\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,N&#39;\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}(\\sigma,\\sigma),\\tau)\">\\(N,N&#39;\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}(\\sigma,\\sigma),\\tau)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}(\\sigma,\\sigma))^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Theta\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}(\\sigma,\\sigma))^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,D,\\Delta,x,y,\\rho\">\\(n,D,\\Delta,x,y,\\rho\\)</span> 为显示式定义的局部记号；列表拼接和列表替换均采用上述来源。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nn&amp;\\coloneqq|\\Gamma|,\\qquad D\\coloneqq\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}(\\sigma),\\qquad\\Delta\\coloneqq\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}(\\sigma,\\sigma),\\\\\nx&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,n+1\\rangle,\\qquad y\\coloneqq\\langle0,n+2\\rangle,\\\\\n\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq(\\langle0,1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\langle0,n\\rangle,x,x)\n\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma(D,\\Delta).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nn&amp;\\coloneqq|\\Gamma|,\\qquad D\\coloneqq\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}(\\sigma),\\qquad\\Delta\\coloneqq\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}(\\sigma,\\sigma),\\\\\nx&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,n+1\\rangle,\\qquad y\\coloneqq\\langle0,n+2\\rangle,\\\\\n\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq(\\langle0,1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\langle0,n\\rangle,x,x)\n\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma(D,\\Delta).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(D\\mid\\Theta[\\rho]\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}N[\\rho]=_\\tau N&#39;[\\rho]\\bigr)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\Delta\\mid\\Theta\\mathbin{+\\!+}((\\sigma,x,y))\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}N=_\\tau N&#39;\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(D\\mid\\Theta[\\rho]\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}N[\\rho]=_\\tau N&#39;[\\rho]\\bigr)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\Delta\\mid\\Theta\\mathbin{+\\!+}((\\sigma,x,y))\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}N=_\\tau N&#39;\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>命名的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[x/y]\">\\([x/y]\\)</span> 正是显示的位置收缩代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 为有限假设列表。此处允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 中，因此左侧必须同时替换假设列表。这是 Lemma3.2.4 的 Frobenius 形式；Lemma3.2.3 先假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 中自由出现。</li>\n<li>右至左：用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 替换右侧推导，附加假设变为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=x\">\\(x=x\\)</span>，用反身性与 cut 消去即可。</li>\n<li>左至右：弱化到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=y\">\\(x=y\\)</span> 下用项结构归纳和函数同余得到任意项与其收缩后的项相等。每个原假设都推出其收缩版本，再反复 cut 使用给定推导；最后用对称、传递和 replacement 还原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,N&#39;\">\\(N,N&#39;\\)</span>。replacement 从上游函数同余的项归纳推出。没有非法的 strengthening 步骤。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Lemmas3.2.3–3.2.4，印刷页179–181（PDF199–201）；本轮将命名语法明确接到本地位置编码。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-sigma-equation","status":"resolved","id":"714c179fab3ebb50","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-sigma-equation]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-signature","status":"resolved","id":"afcc53893d447b1b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-algebraic-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-conditional-equational-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"02dbbf0106916f6e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-conditional-equational-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-signature","status":"resolved","id":"afcc53893d447b1b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$S$、$\\mathsf{Ctx}$、$\\mathsf{Tm}$、$\\mathsf{Sub}$ 采用 [[16-df-algebraic-signature]]；$H\\subseteq\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma$ 与 $\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}$ 采用 [[16-df-conditional-equational-derivation]]。所有类型均为不依赖变量的简单排序。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-conditional-equational-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"02dbbf0106916f6e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$S$、$\\mathsf{Ctx}$、$\\mathsf{Tm}$、$\\mathsf{Sub}$ 采用 [[16-df-algebraic-signature]]；$H\\subseteq\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma$ 与 $\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}$ 采用 [[16-df-conditional-equational-derivation]]。所有类型均为不依赖变量的简单排序。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ctx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sub}","display":false},{"tex":"H\\subseteq\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"N,N'\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}(\\sigma,\\sigma),\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}(\\sigma,\\sigma))^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"n,D,\\Delta,x,y,\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nn&\\coloneqq|\\Gamma|,\\qquad D\\coloneqq\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}(\\sigma),\\qquad\\Delta\\coloneqq\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}(\\sigma,\\sigma),\\\\\nx&\\coloneqq\\langle0,n+1\\rangle,\\qquad y\\coloneqq\\langle0,n+2\\rangle,\\\\\n\\rho&\\coloneqq(\\langle0,1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\langle0,n\\rangle,x,x)\n\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma(D,\\Delta).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigl(D\\mid\\Theta[\\rho]\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}N[\\rho]=_\\tau N'[\\rho]\\bigr)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\Delta\\mid\\Theta\\mathbin{+\\!+}((\\sigma,x,y))\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}N=_\\tau N'\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"[x/y]","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"x=x","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"x=y","display":false},{"tex":"N,N'","display":false}],"bytes":2587,"backlinks":[{"id":"5b7d7fba37c620c4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"等式左伴随以复制位置的相等补入假设。逐个应用 [[16-lem-lawvere]]，并在需要时交换语境位置，得到所列伴随；同一证明允许任意额外假设列表，故给Frobenius。参数替换与复制位置相等相容，给参数BC。空列表的情形也成立。以上是对局部编码的证明复核，未经机器检查；没有把纤维中的互相可推导提升为基底中的箭头相等。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-77","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-algebraic-signature]]、[[16-df-equational-derivation]]、[[16-df-algebraic-category]]、[[16-thm-algebraic-category]]、[[16-df-algebraic-model]]、[[16-df-conditional-equational-derivation]]、[[16-lem-lawvere]]、[[16-thm-completeness-eq]]。条件等式现有本书内分类纤维化和模型扩张构造，见 [[16-df-equational-classifying-fibration]]、[[16-df-equational-fibred-model]]、[[16-thm-model-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["714c179fab3ebb50","afcc53893d447b1b","02dbbf0106916f6e"]}